{"metadata":{"externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK11PageRequestV6searchSSSgvp","symbolKind":"property","roleHeading":"Instance Property","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"search"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"title":"search","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"role":"symbol"},"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/PageRequest\/search","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/pagerequest\/search"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"abstract":[{"text":"A free-text filter applied by the SERVER, before ","type":"text"},{"code":"offset","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"\/","type":"text"},{"code":"limit","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", or ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for none.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/PageRequest"]]},"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"search"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Matched case-insensitively against the identifying fields of whatever is being"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"listed — a name or username, plus the record id, so a UUID out of a log line can be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"pasted in as-is. Which fields exactly is the server’s business; "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Page.total"},{"type":"text","text":" then"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"counts MATCHES rather than rows, which is what lets a pager built on it show a page"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"count belonging to the result set it is paging."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It lives here, beside "},{"code":"offset","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code":"limit","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", rather than as an extra argument on each"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of the twenty generated "},{"code":"list","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" methods (§27.4 rule 4). That is what makes "},{"code":"next()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"carry it, and so what makes a manual walk filter the WHOLE walk: one that sent the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"term on its first request and dropped it on the second would return the matches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"followed by the unfiltered tail, which reads as a server bug from the caller’s side."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Stored as the caller gave it; ","type":"text"},{"code":"queryPairs","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is where it is normalised.","type":"text"}]}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"references":{"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/PageRequest/search":{"type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"search"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":"?"}],"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/PageRequest\/search","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/pagerequest\/search","abstract":[{"text":"A free-text filter applied by the SERVER, before ","type":"text"},{"code":"offset","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"\/","type":"text"},{"code":"limit","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", or ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for none.","type":"text"}],"title":"search","kind":"symbol"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/PageRequest":{"role":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PageRequest","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"PageRequest","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/pagerequest","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"PageRequest","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"One page’s worth of "},{"code":"?offset=","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"\/"},{"code":"?limit=","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/PageRequest"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK":{"role":"collection","type":"topic","title":"AxiamSDK","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The official Swift SDK for AXIAM (Access eXtended Identity and Authorization Management)."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK"}}}